  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\">AMJ Society makes modern American Mahjong cards for a new generation of players. Our 2026 cards are beginner-friendly, beautifully designed, and updated every year using official NMJL rules. We sell card sets ($29), bundles with hats or tote bags ($34), and digital downloads ($5). Everything is designed and printed in California with free shipping on every order.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;min-height:15px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\">We're the modern alternative to traditional mahjong cards — fresh designs that are easier to read, beginner-friendly layouts, and a brand built for women who want to bring new friends into the game. Our customers love the quality, the aesthetic, and that we're a small woman-run business, not a faceless corporation.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;min-height:15px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\">Earn a commission on every sale you refer. Share your unique link with your mahjong group, social media followers, blog readers, or email list. When someone purchases through your link, you get paid. It's that simple — we handle shipping, customer service, everything.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;min-height:15px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\">Show the cards! Our product photographs beautifully — unbox it, fan out the cards at game night, show the bundle with the hat or tote. Tag us <span style=\"color:#1f6bc0;\">@americanmahjongsociety</span> on Instagram. We'll provide you with product images and suggested copy, but authenticity works best — just tell your group why you like the cards.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;min-height:15px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><strong>Other information:</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:13px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\">We're a growing brand based in Manhattan Beach, CA. Mahjong is inherently social — every customer plays with 3+ friends, so word-of-mouth is powerful. If you're a mahjong teacher, group organizer, lifestyle blogger, or content creator who reaches women 30-60, we'd love to work with you.</p></div></div>",
